WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Background music]
Project spotlight: Moda Andina Logistics. Pick-to-light and zoning.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Before: a mixed order sends the picker through every aisle, about 1.1 km per route.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
After: ABC slotting, zoning and pick-to-light, about 0.5 km per route.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Results: peak orders per day 10,500 to 18,200 (+73%). Pick route 1.1 to 0.5 km (-55%). Order accuracy 98.9% to 99.8% (+0.9 pp).

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Nexora Intralogistics Solutions.
